 div style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 14px; background: #f0f4f8; b
 order: 1px solid #edbb00; border-left: 5px solid #edbb00; text-align:
  left;"><h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #004d98; font-size: 14px; ma
 rgin-bottom: 8px;">Anahata ASI Update Center: Universal Cross-Version
  NetBeans Installer</h3><p style="font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 0; 
 color: #4a5568;">A lightweight, standalone NetBeans Platform module w
 ith zero implementation locks. Provides automated NetBeans version de
 tection, dynamic Anahata ASI Update Center catalog registration (Univ
 ersal, Stable, and Dev Snapshots), and 1-click installation of Anahat
 a ASI Studio and JavaFX runtimes across all NetBeans versions (NB 21 
 &ndash; NB 35+).</p></div><div style="margin: 20px 0; padding: 15px; 
 background: #f7fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: left;"><h
 4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #2d3748; font-size: 15px; text-transfo
 rm: uppercase;"><span style="color: #004d98;">◆</span> Key Update Cen
 ter Features</h4><ul style="color: #4a5568; font-size: 12px; margin: 
 0; padding-left: 20px;"><li><b>Zero Version Lock-in:</b> Relies exclu
 sively on public OpenIDE APIs. Survives NetBeans upgrades without bre
 akage.</li><li><b>Dynamic Catalog Routing:</b> Automatically resolves
  the exact update catalog for your active NetBeans major release.</li
 ><li><b>1-Click Installation:</b> Seamlessly downloads, validates, an
 d installs Anahata ASI Studio from within the IDE.</li><li><b>JavaFX 
 Activation:</b> Verifies host JDK JavaFX runtime support and activate
 s the NetBeans JavaFX kit when needed.</li><li><b>Legacy Center Clean
 up:</b> Detects and removes obsolete update centers from previous Net
 Beans versions.</li></ul></div><hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px 
 solid #e2e8f0; margin: 20px 0;"/><h3 style="font-size: 16px; color: #
